iving the interdimensional journey. Dubbed &quot;Omega Mouse,&quot; it became the focal point of reseach and experimentation by the Cats In Black throughout the Omega-Verse.<br> <br>Amidst the frenzy of their endeavors, Shadow Cat had a stunning revelation.  It became clear to him that within the vast expanse of the Omega-Verse, where infinite possibilities lay, there must be a universe where Omega Mouse is more powerful than him - a universe where Omega Mouse reached it's prime.<br><br>With it's inherent power of interdimensional travel, Shadow Cat knows it's only a matter of time before Omega Mouse Prime shows up seeking retribution against him and his allies for their many crimes against mice across the Omega-Verse.",
